  "wgc_method": "Same 2052x1128 static source displayed in a native window, captured via WGC. Real player inventory panel required all three current names at first paint and all observed IDs present for grid paint. Fresh starts from an operator page without prior held items. Map starts cold and then switches to inventory. Eight isolated processes; baseline replaces only BarProjection with original full-width ProjectionScreen. Other system load not standardized. No live game input. Six paired complete observations agree excluding timing and runtime metadata.",
  "conclusion": "Four inventory switches: full list median 3887 to 3844 ms. Paired changes varied from 786 ms faster to 449 ms slower. First names: 1406 to 1357 ms, no causal speedup claimed because icon screening follows name recognition. New first-name range 1263–2622 ms. All cases above 500 ms. A sub-500 ms standalone OCR call does not establish sub-500 ms display.",
