  "remaining": "Current full-page OCR before first names took 836–2035 ms on four candidate WGC inventory switches. Need faster whole-frame page qualification and text discovery under realistic CPU load. Dense and narrow bar timings show small regressions; the local benchmark and four WGC pairs do not establish general improvement."
